    <string name="have_a_litertlm_litert_lm_model_import_2">Have a .litertlm (LiteRT-LM) model? Import it from the menu like a GGUF. The app copies it into its own storage first, which takes its size in free space and a while for a multi-GB file. Download lists GGUFs only.</string>
    <string name="copied_a_gguf_onto_this_phone_with_a_2">Copied a .gguf onto this phone with a cable, or downloaded one already? Find models on this phone in the menu finds models the app can already see.</string>
